====Usage notes====
* {{sense|Teachta Dála}} In English the abbreviation TD is normally used, with TDs as the plural (the full form of which in Irish is {{m|ga|Teachtaí Dála}}). The letters follow the name of the member when used as a title, e.g. ''Mr Bertie Ahern TD''.

